  "text_pages": [
    "Business and IT – Østfold University of Applied Sciences\nBusiness and IT\nIT professionals with business management skills are sought-after all over the world. Prepare yourself for an exciting career with our one-year programme in Business and IT.\nThe bachelor program in Information Systems at Østfold University of Applied Sciences in Norway, is launching a new programme for international students:\nAutumn\nSpring\nManagement and Communication\nBusiness IT\n10 ECTS\n10 ECTS\n10 ECTS\n10 ECTS\n10 ECTS\n10 ECTS\nProject Managemen\nt\nBusiness Intelligence\nProfessional Communication\nDigitalisation Strategy\nDevOps and Low-code development\nBusiness Software\nAll courses are taught at our campus in Halden.\nThe programme is an international alternative integrated into the ordinary curriculum, so you will meet and work with Norwegian students and companies all the time. Students may take the courses as a full-year study, single semester, or as individual courses.\nContact persons\nInternational coordinators\nMonica Kristensen Holone\nand\nLars Emil Skrimstad Knudsen\nPublished\nAug. 28, 2023 12:29 PM\n-\nLast modified\nMar. 16, 2026 9:39 AM\nE-mail this page\nShare on Facebook\nShare on X"
  ],
